-- הסכם עוז לתמורה (14.8.2011), §36 תגמול עובדי הוראה בגין הישגי בית
-- הספר: a programme of the Ministry's rewards the teachers of the upper
-- division for their school's achievements; the teachers of the schools
-- found highest in a year — 40% of the programme's schools at most, 30% at
-- least — get a one-time grant by the school's tenth (8,000, 6,000, 4,000,
-- 3,000 for a full position), increased where fewer than 40% are found; in
-- proportion to the position and to the part of the year, maternity leave
-- excepted, beyond a full position not counted; paid with August's salary;
-- updated every June by the CPI; if the programme is not ready by
-- 31.8.2012, 1,600 to every teacher of תשע"ב; no hour value, severance,
-- percentage supplements or training fund, pension contributions of 5% and
-- 5%.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT parties
IMPORT vocabulary
IMPORT conventions
IMPORT `oz-founding-common`
IMPORT `oz-founding-2`

§ `36 תגמול עובדי הוראה בגין הישגי בית הספר`

DECLARE `Oz section 36 action` IS ONE OF
    `pay the achievement grants of the school year`

§§ `36(א)`

-- (א): in the schools, for grades ט'–י"ב/י"ד in a four-year school and
-- י'–י"ב/י"ד in a three-year or six-year school, a programme rewards the
-- teachers for the achievements (in learning, social and in values) of the
-- school they are employed in, by a format and rules the Ministry of
-- Education sets and updates from time to time ("התוכנית"). A school of
-- another kind is no school of the agreement (§§2, 4(ח)).
@ref akn:art_36__para_a
GIVEN k IS A `kind of Oz school`
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the lowest grade section 36's programme covers in` k IS
    CONSIDER k
    WHEN `a four-year school, grades 9 to 12` THEN JUST 9
    WHEN `a three-year school, grades 10 to 12` THEN JUST 10
    WHEN `a six-year school, grades 7 to 12` THEN JUST 10
    WHEN `a school of another kind` THEN NOTHING

`why section 36's programme is not here` MEANS
    `set elsewhere` "מתכונת וכללים לתכנית התגמול בגין הישגי בית הספר, שיגובשו על-ידי משרד החינוך ויעודכנו מעת לעת (\"התוכנית\")"

§§ `36(ב)–(ג)`

-- (ב): the teachers employed in the schools whose achievements were found
-- highest in a school year — "עד 40%" of the schools the programme runs in
-- that year "אך לא פחות מ- 30%" — are entitled to a one-time grant, by the
-- school's rank: the highest 10%, 8,000 for a full position; the next 10%,
-- 6,000; the next, 4,000; the next, 3,000. "עד 40%" takes in 40%, the four
-- tenths the table pays (an exception to convention thresholds.until), and
-- "לא פחות מ-30%" takes in 30%. A school is in a tenth when its place in
-- the ranking is within that share of the programme's schools, counted
-- exactly (convention rounding.default), schools found equal sharing a
-- place (convention thresholds.ties), as §20(ב) counts teachers.
@ref akn:art_36__para_b
`the most section 36 finds highest` MEANS 40%
`the fewest section 36 finds highest` MEANS 30%

GIVEN `the share found highest` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a share section 36(ב) allows` `the share found highest` IF
        `the share found highest` AT LEAST `the fewest section 36 finds highest`
    AND `the share found highest` AT MOST `the most section 36 finds highest`

@ref akn:art_36__para_b/t1
GIVEN `schools ranked above it` IS A NUMBER
      `the programme's schools` IS A NUMBER @desc the schools the programme runs in that school year
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the grant section 36's table gives a full position in a school with` `schools ranked above it` `the programme's schools` IS
    BRANCH
        IF place AT MOST 10% TIMES `the programme's schools` THEN 8000
        IF place AT MOST 20% TIMES `the programme's schools` THEN 6000
        IF place AT MOST 30% TIMES `the programme's schools` THEN 4000
        IF place AT MOST 40% TIMES `the programme's schools` THEN 3000
        OTHERWISE 0
    WHERE
        place MEANS `schools ranked above it` PLUS 1

GIVEN `schools ranked above it` IS A NUMBER
      `the programme's schools` IS A NUMBER
      `the share found highest` IS A NUMBER @desc the share of the programme's schools whose achievements were found highest that year
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a school section 36 rewards` `schools ranked above it` `the programme's schools` `the share found highest` IF
    `schools ranked above it` PLUS 1 AT MOST `the share found highest` TIMES `the programme's schools`

-- (ג): where the schools of high achievement are fewer than 40% of the
-- programme's schools that year, but more than 30% (convention
-- thresholds.above; "פחות מ-40%" is below 40%), "יוגדלו סכומי המענק
-- בהתאם". The text does not say by how much, nor on which tenths
-- (F-oz-founding-36-a). The reading adopted (convention amounts.not-printed):
-- such a grant is increased by an amount the text does not print, and the
-- encoding gives none; at exactly 30% (ב)'s amounts stand.
@ref akn:art_36__para_c
GIVEN `the share found highest` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `section 36(ג) increases the grants at` `the share found highest` IF
        `the share found highest` `is above` `the fewest section 36 finds highest`
    AND `the share found highest` LESS THAN `the most section 36 finds highest`

`why the grants section 36(ג) increases have no figure` MEANS
    `the text is silent` "F-oz-founding-36-a"

-- The grant for a full position in a school: (ב)'s table for a school it
-- rewards at a share (ב) allows, as signed; NOTHING where (ג) increases it.
GIVEN `schools ranked above it` IS A NUMBER
      `the programme's schools` IS A NUMBER
      `the share found highest` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the section 36 grant for a full position, as signed` `schools ranked above it` `the programme's schools` `the share found highest` IS
    IF NOT (    `a share section 36(ב) allows` `the share found highest`
            AND `a school section 36 rewards` `schools ranked above it` `the programme's schools` `the share found highest`)
    THEN JUST 0
    ELSE IF `section 36(ג) increases the grants at` `the share found highest`
         THEN NOTHING
         ELSE JUST (`the grant section 36's table gives a full position in a school with` `schools ranked above it` `the programme's schools`)

§§ `36(ד)–(ה)`

-- (ד): a teacher employed part-time and/or in part of a school year (on
-- unpaid leave or sabbatical in part of it among them) is entitled to the
-- proportional part, by his position and/or the part of the year he was
-- employed — save a teacher on maternity leave under the Women's
-- Employment Law, 1954, for the period of the leave (not unpaid leave or an
-- absence like it after the leave ends): her leave is counted as a time
-- she was employed. The part of the year is of twelve months (convention
-- dates.school-year-share). (ה): employment beyond 100% of a position is
-- not counted.
@ref akn:art_36__para_d akn:art_36__para_e
GIVEN t IS AN `Oz grant teacher`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the part of the year section 36(ד) counts for` t IS
    `the share of a school year` (t's `months employed` PLUS t's `months on maternity leave`)

`why the Women's Employment Law is not encoded` MEANS
    `outside the corpus` "חוק עבודת נשים, התשי\"ד-1954 (חופשת לידה)"

§§ `36(ו)`

-- (ו): the grants are paid with the salary for August (convention
-- dates.salary-month), to the teachers employed in the school in that
-- school year: August of y + 1 for the school year y.
@ref akn:art_36__para_f
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the salary month of section 36's grants for school year` y IS
    `the Oz salary month` (y PLUS 1) 8

`paying the achievement grants` MEANS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `pay the achievement grants of the school year`
    LEST  BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "§36(ו): the grants are paid with August's salary to the teachers employed in the school that year"

§§ `36(ז)`

-- (ז): the amounts are updated every June, from June 2012, by the CPI, in
-- the words of §35(ה) (`an Oz grant updated each June`).
@ref akn:art_36__para_g
GIVEN amount IS A NUMBER
      `the May indices` IS A LIST OF NUMBER @desc the CPI for May of each year from May 2011 to the May before the last June update, in order
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `a section 36 grant as updated` amount `the May indices` IS
    `an Oz grant updated each June` amount `the May indices`

§§ `36(ח)`

-- (ח): if the programme is not ready for paying the teachers by 31.8.2012
-- (the day included: convention dates.end), then at the end of תשע"ב every
-- teacher employed in תשע"ב is entitled to a one-time grant: 1,600 for a
-- full position; part-time or part of the year (unpaid leave or
-- sabbatical among them, maternity leave excepted as in (ד)), the
-- proportional part, the year being "ספטמבר עד יוני" — ten months.
@ref akn:art_36__para_h
`the section 36(ח) grant for a full position, as signed` MEANS 1600

`the months of section 36(ח)'s year` MEANS 10

GIVEN t IS AN `Oz grant teacher`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the part of the year section 36(ח) counts for` t IS
    (t's `months employed from September to June` PLUS t's `months on maternity leave from September to June`) DIVIDED BY `the months of section 36(ח)'s year`

§§ `36(ט)–(י)`

-- (ט): the grants are not in the base of the hour value, of severance pay
-- or of a percentage supplement, and no training fund contribution is made
-- on them. (י): pension provident fund contributions are made on them, 5%
-- by the employer for benefits and 5% deducted from the teacher's salary
-- for benefits. Neither names the Dafna fund (convention
-- reading.closed-list).
@ref akn:art_36__para_i akn:art_36__para_j
GIVEN p IS A `what an Oz salary component counts for`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the section 36 grants count for` p IF
    p EQUALS `contributions to a pension provident fund`

`the employer's pension contribution rate on a section 36 grant` MEANS 5%
`the teacher's pension deduction rate on a section 36 grant` MEANS 5%

§§ `36 -- the grants`

-- (ב)–(ז) together: a teacher's grant for a school year, from the school's
-- rank and the May indices the amount has been updated by. NOTHING where
-- (ג) increases the grants.
GIVEN t IS AN `Oz grant teacher`
      `schools ranked above it` IS A NUMBER
      `the programme's schools` IS A NUMBER
      `the share found highest` IS A NUMBER
      `the May indices` IS A LIST OF NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the achievement grant under section 36` t `schools ranked above it` `the programme's schools` `the share found highest` `the May indices` IS
    CONSIDER `the section 36 grant for a full position, as signed` `schools ranked above it` `the programme's schools` `the share found highest`
    WHEN JUST amount THEN JUST (`an Oz grant pro rata` (`a section 36 grant as updated` amount `the May indices`) (t's `position share`) (`the part of the year section 36(ד) counts for` t))
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING

-- (ח): the grant at the end of תשע"ב, where the programme was not ready.
GIVEN `the programme was ready to pay by 31.8.2012` IS A BOOLEAN
      t IS AN `Oz grant teacher` @desc in תשע"ב
      `the May indices` IS A LIST OF NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the section 36(ח) grant` `the programme was ready to pay by 31.8.2012` t `the May indices` IS
    IF NOT `the programme was ready to pay by 31.8.2012`
    THEN `an Oz grant pro rata` (`a section 36 grant as updated` `the section 36(ח) grant for a full position, as signed` `the May indices`) (t's `position share`) (`the part of the year section 36(ח) counts for` t)
    ELSE 0

§§ `36 -- illustrations`

GIVEN position IS A NUMBER, months IS A NUMBER, maternity IS A NUMBER
GIVETH AN `Oz grant teacher`
DECIDE `a teacher of the programme at` position `for` months `months, with` maternity `on maternity leave` IS
    `Oz grant teacher` WITH
        `position share`                                   IS position
        `months employed`                                  IS months
        `months on maternity leave`                        IS maternity
        `months employed from September to June`           IS min months 10
        `months on maternity leave from September to June` IS maternity
        `months on unpaid leave or sabbatical`             IS 0
        `a substitute only`                                IS FALSE
        `on the reform's terms`                            IS `off the Oz reform`

`no section 36 update yet` MEANS EMPTY

#ASSERT `the lowest grade section 36's programme covers in` `a four-year school, grades 9 to 12` EQUALS JUST 9
-- of 100 programme schools with 40 found highest: the 5th, 15th, 25th and
-- 35th by the four tenths; the 45th nothing
#ASSERT `the section 36 grant for a full position, as signed` 4 100 (40%) EQUALS JUST 8000
#ASSERT `the section 36 grant for a full position, as signed` 14 100 (40%) EQUALS JUST 6000
#ASSERT `the section 36 grant for a full position, as signed` 24 100 (40%) EQUALS JUST 4000
#ASSERT `the section 36 grant for a full position, as signed` 34 100 (40%) EQUALS JUST 3000
#ASSERT `the section 36 grant for a full position, as signed` 44 100 (40%) EQUALS JUST 0
-- at 30% the fourth tenth is not reached, and (ב)'s amounts stand
#ASSERT `the section 36 grant for a full position, as signed` 24 100 (30%) EQUALS JUST 4000
#ASSERT `the section 36 grant for a full position, as signed` 34 100 (30%) EQUALS JUST 0
-- at 35%, (ג) increases them by an amount the text does not print
#ASSERT `the section 36 grant for a full position, as signed` 4 100 (35%) EQUALS NOTHING
-- maternity leave counts as employment: three months of it, the full grant
#ASSERT `the achievement grant under section 36` (`a teacher of the programme at` 1 `for` 9 `months, with` 3 `on maternity leave`) 4 100 (40%) `no section 36 update yet` EQUALS JUST 8000
#ASSERT `the achievement grant under section 36` (`a teacher of the programme at` 0.5 `for` 12 `months, with` 0 `on maternity leave`) 14 100 (40%) `no section 36 update yet` EQUALS JUST 3000
#ASSERT `the section 36(ח) grant` FALSE (`a teacher of the programme at` 1 `for` 10 `months, with` 0 `on maternity leave`) `no section 36 update yet` EQUALS 1600
#ASSERT `the section 36(ח) grant` TRUE (`a teacher of the programme at` 1 `for` 10 `months, with` 0 `on maternity leave`) `no section 36 update yet` EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the salary month of section 36's grants for school year` `the school year 5772` EQUALS `the Oz salary month` 2012 8
#ASSERT `the section 36 grants count for` `contributions to a pension provident fund` AND NOT `the section 36 grants count for` `contributions to a training fund`

-- F-oz-founding-36-a's evidence: between 30% and 40% (ג) increases the
-- grants and prints no measure, so a school in the first tenth has no
-- figure, where at 40% and at 30% it has (ב)'s.
`section 36(ג) increases the grants by an unprinted amount` MEANS
        `section 36(ג) increases the grants at` (35%)
    AND `the section 36 grant for a full position, as signed` 4 100 (35%) EQUALS NOTHING
    AND `the section 36 grant for a full position, as signed` 4 100 (40%) EQUALS JUST 8000
#ASSERT `section 36(ג) increases the grants by an unprinted amount`
